          "text": "{\"a2uiMeta\":{\"note\":\"Here's how the two compare for Friday 20 November 2026. The train is my recommendation: it goes city centre to city centre and is quicker door to door. Prices and times are illustrative demo values. Which would you like to take?\",\"ask\":{\"surfaceId\":\"ask-1\"}}}\n\nThe Eurostar runs direct from St Pancras to Paris Gare du Nord in about 2h 16m, so it's roughly 3 hours door to door. A flight to Paris CDG is about 1h 15m in the air, but with airport travel and check-in it usually takes 4 to 5 hours. The flight can be cheaper on some days, but it tends to cost more once bags are added.\n\n{\"version\":\"v1.0\",\"createSurface\":{\"surfaceId\":\"ask-1\",\"catalogId\":\"agent-ui--hospitality\",\"sendDataModel\":true}}\n{\"version\":\"v1.0\",\"updateComponents\":{\"surfaceId\":\"ask-1\",\"components\":[{\"id\":\"root\",\"component\":\"OptionCompare\",\"heading\":\"London to Paris, Friday 20 November 2026\",\"actionName\":\"choose\",\"best\":\"train\",\"rows\":[{\"key\":\"duration\",\"label\":\"Travel time\"},{\"key\":\"doorToDoor\",\"label\":\"Door to door\"},{\"key\":\"price\",\"label\":\"Price (illustrative)\"},{\"key\":\"baggage\",\"label\":\"Luggage\"}],\"options\":[{\"value\":\"train\",\"title\":\"Eurostar\",\"subtitle\":\"St Pancras to Paris Gare du Nord\",\"values\":{\"duration\":\"2h 16m, direct\",\"doorToDoor\":\"About 3h\",\"price\":\"From about £80 one way\",\"baggage\":\"Generous allowance, no hold-bag fees\"}},{\"value\":\"flight\",\"title\":\"Flight\",\"subtitle\":\"London to Paris CDG\",\"values\":{\"duration\":\"About 1h 15m in the air\",\"doorToDoor\":\"About 4 to 5h\",\"price\":\"From about £90 one way\",\"baggage\":\"Hold bags usually extra\"}}]}}}",
